    "created_at": "2017-03-01T14:33:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-01T14:33:52Z",
    "body": "Well, you can set certain headers today even for `no-cors` (e.g., `Accept`). So the flag would mostly be about preserving those, while removing the others. If we drop all headers, while simpler, we'd also end up regressing on functionality we offer today.",
