    "created_at": "2017-03-01T17:59:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-01T17:59:40Z",
    "body": "@annevk Yes, I meant removing only non-whitelisted headers (whitelist is already part of the spec) on cross-origin redirect. This will preserve backward compatibility and will still try to send as much changed headers as allowed for that specific context.",
